{"3599860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Phonkside Killers", "steam_appid": 3599860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHONKSIDE KILLERS</strong> is a retro boomer shooter inspired by 90s cult classics, glitchy VHS visuals and phonk aesthetic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through zombie soldiers, succubus demons and floating cultist monks to escape this horror tape straight out of the 90s. Explore a dark world full of supernatural forces, rizz some hot baddies and uncover the secrets of the occult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/da79cda11a0dc7cbeecc9b6628dc64aa.poster.avif?t=1762850905\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/da79cda11a0dc7cbeecc9b6628dc64aa.webm?t=1762850905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/da79cda11a0dc7cbeecc9b6628dc64aa.mp4?t=1762850905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies to kill:</strong>  <br>+ Shoot 9mm, Buckshot, TEK-9, Scope and other weapons <br>+ Fight different enemy types <br>+ Collect ammo &amp; power-ups, you know, classic stuff<br>+ Mortal Kombat levels of blood splatter<br>+ Exploding barrels (industry standard)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and press [ E ] on some objects:</strong>  <br>+ Explore creepy hospitals, abandoned office floors, dark woods, shady motels and other locations <br>+ Interact with various objects: open doors, pull levers, use laptops, etc.<br>+ Find hidden areas and uncover secrets scattered throughout the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impress anime girls with your high-score and fast times:</strong>  <br>+ Basic score/rank system upon clearing the level<br>+ Talk to some characters. (dialog is optional) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/b8a7838605e0e6d74dd246e134a1a13c.poster.avif?t=1762850905\" width=690 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/b8a7838605e0e6d74dd246e134a1a13c.webm?t=1762850905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/b8a7838605e0e6d74dd246e134a1a13c.mp4?t=1762850905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phonk soundtrack to pump you up:</strong><br><strong>+ </strong>Various phonk styles: cowbell/drift/house/memphis/cloud phonk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS shaders to melt your integrated laptop graphics card with glitchy visuals: </strong> <br>+ Noise, chromatic abberation, ghosting, visual distortion, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made by solo indie developer, so: </strong> <br><strong>+ </strong>Your feedback can help improve the game <br>+ I'm generating anime girls with ai to save development time (ai disclosure for feds)<br>+ pls, i need your feedback, pls pls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop plays